{"term": {"label": "仁", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "3B", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/teng-wen-gong-ii", "title": "滕文公下", "description": "陳代曰：「不見諸侯，宜若小然；今一見之，大則以王，小則以霸。且志曰：『枉尺而直尋』，宜若可為也。」\n孟子曰：「昔齊景公田，招虞人以旌，不至，將殺之。志士不忘在溝壑，勇士不忘喪其元。孔子奚取焉？取非其招不往也，如不待其招而往，何哉？且夫枉尺而直尋者，以利言也。如以利，則枉尋直尺而利，亦可為與？昔者趙簡子使王良與嬖奚乘，終", "occurrences": 3, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "人", "id": "人"}, {"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "伯", "id": "伯"}, {"form": "兄", "id": "兄"}, {"form": "室", "id": "室"}, {"form": "害", "id": "害"}, {"form": "民", "id": "民"}, {"form": "為", "id": "爲"}, {"form": "獸", "id": "獸"}, {"form": "率", "id": "率"}, {"form": "知", "id": "知"}, {"form": "祿", "id": "祿"}, {"form": "禽", "id": "禽"}, {"form": "義", "id": "義"}, {"form": "至", "id": "至"}, {"form": "食", "id": "食"}], "edges": [{"weight": 3.505128304510387, "source": "祿", "target": "兄"}, {"weight": 1.7133688352823322, "source": "祿", "target": "爲"}, {"weight": 2.9661318037777002, "source": "祿", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 1.1537530473469095, "source": "兄", "target": "爲"}, {"weight": 2.4065160158422776, "source": "兄", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 2.588837572636232, "source": "兄", "target": "室"}, {"weight": 2.8119811239504418, "source": "兄", "target": "至"}, {"weight": 0.5576863200841773, "source": "食", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 1.2169319489684411, "source": "食", "target": "伯"}, {"weight": 0.2361026959567149, "source": "食", "target": "民"}, {"weight": 1.0627812691411829, "source": "食", "target": "獸"}, {"weight": 1.9100791295283865, "source": "食", "target": "率"}, {"weight": 1.2169319489684411, "source": "食", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 0.5237847684084959, "source": "食", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 2.272984623217755, "source": "伯", "target": "民"}, {"weight": 3.253813876229481, "source": "伯", "target": "率"}, {"weight": 2.272984623217755, "source": "率", "target": "民"}, {"weight": 1.678277515471062, "source": "率", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 3.099663196402223, "source": "率